# @name RemoveSecondKeyRow
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [204]
DELETE {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders/{{DifferentKeySameShape.response.body.$.id}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}

